OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith rain spreading southwards and
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy at times. Winds easing
OL,9,Fa touch overnight but still strong at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy with rain, heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes, slowly clearing to the south
OL,14,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,15,Fafternoon. Drier with bright spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
